Error [E0378]: This alias declaration uses the retired `=` binding.
  --> tests/ui/type_alias_old_syntax.jet:1:19
    |
  1 | alias ResultOf<T> = T ? Int
    |                   ^
 Why: `::` defines a name; `=` fills a slot inside an existing declaration (D-ALIAS-OP1=B).
 Fix: Replace `=` with `::`.
